<p>50 or more, largest first:
  {array:large~}
    {$number} ({$total}){property:notLast@large}, {/property:notLast@large}
  {~/array:large}</p>
<p>A customer starting with C: {array:withC~}
  {$customer}{property:notLast@withC}, {/property:notLast@withC}
{~/array:withC}</p>
<p>Not paid yet: {array:unpaid~}
  {$number}{property:notLast@unpaid}, {/property:notLast@unpaid}
{~/array:unpaid}</p>
<p>First open order: {$first}, last paid order: {$last}</p>
